  "privacyCollectionTitle": "1. Information we collect",
  "privacyAccount": "Account information. For password sign-in, we store your username and a salted password hash, not your password. For Google sign-in, we generate a username. For Telegram sign-in, we use your Telegram username if it is available and not already taken; otherwise, we generate one.",
  "privacyGoogle": "Google sign-in. If you use \"Sign in with Google\", we receive and store the profile information Google provides with your consent, which may include your email address, name and profile picture.",
  "privacyTelegram": "Telegram sign-in. If you use Telegram to sign in — inside the Candle Mini App or from the Candle app or website — we receive your numeric Telegram ID to recognize your account. We do not receive your phone number. If you set a language in our Telegram bot, we store that preference against your Telegram ID to personalize the Mini App.",
  "privacyContent": "Content you create. We store candle messages, uploaded background images and their generated thumbnails and sharing previews. If you place a candle on the map, we store and display its selected coordinates and address. Your username, candles and their public content can be seen by other users and people who open shared links.",
  "privacyLocation": "Device location and maps. With your permission, Candle obtains your current location to center the map. We do not continuously track you or record a GPS history. Map requests identify the area you are viewing. Map tiles are requested from OpenStreetMap, and address searches and selected coordinates are sent to the Photon service at photon.komoot.io to find addresses. These services also receive connection information such as your IP address. A location selected for a candle is saved when you confirm placing it on the map.",
  "privacyModeration": "Interactions and moderation. We record which signed-in users support each candle to count unique supporters. We also store reports and author blocks. Recent candles and your selected language are saved locally on your device; a language preference selected in our Telegram bot is stored on our server.",
  "privacyTechnical": "Technical information. Like most online services, our servers and infrastructure providers (including our content delivery network) process connection metadata such as IP address, timestamps and request identifiers to keep Candle reliable, secure and free of abuse.",
  "privacyUsageTitle": "2. How we use information",
  "privacyUsage": "We use the information above to create and secure your account, show your candles and the candles of others, let you personalize and share candles, operate reporting and blocking, keep the service reliable, and prevent abuse. We do not use your information for advertising, and Candle does not contain third-party analytics or advertising SDKs.",
  "privacySharingTitle": "3. How we share information",
  "privacySharing": "We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with the service providers that run Candle on our behalf — hosting, object storage for uploaded images, and our content delivery network — and with Google or Telegram when you choose to sign in with them, to the extent needed to verify your identity. We may also disclose information if required by law, or to protect the rights, safety or property of Candle and its users.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "4. Data retention and account deletion",
  "privacyRetention": "You can delete your account and all associated personal data from Profile in the app or web version. Visit https://candle.vyachdiliger.com/delete-account, sign in, choose Delete account and confirm. This permanently deletes your account and its associated data, including sign-in information, candles and uploaded images. This action cannot be undone.",
  "privacyChoicesTitle": "5. Your choices",
  "privacyChoices": "You can change your username, set or change a password, manage blocked authors, and replace or remove a candle background. You can refuse or revoke location permission in your device, browser or Telegram settings and move the map manually. Contact us for requests concerning your account data.",
  "privacyChildrenTitle": "6. Public content and younger users",
  "privacyChildren": "Candle contains messages and images published by other users. This content is not individually approved before publication. Users can report content and block authors. Parents and guardians should consider these public-content features when deciding whether the service is appropriate for a child, and contact us about concerns involving a child’s data.",
  "privacySecurityTitle": "7. Security",
  "privacySecurity": "We use industry-standard measures such as password hashing and encrypted connections to protect your information, but no method of storage or transmission is completely secure.",
  "privacyChangesTitle": "8. Changes to this policy",
  "privacyChanges": "We may update this policy as Candle changes. We will update the date below when we do, and material changes will be reflected here before they take effect.",
  "privacyContactTitle": "9. Contact us",
  "privacyContact": "For questions about privacy and your account data, contact 20chandrey06@gmail.com.",
  "privacyUpdated": "Last updated October 22, 2026",
  "privacyIntro": "This policy explains what information Candle collects, how we use it, and the choices you have. Candle lets you light a virtual candle, add a message and an optional background image, and share it with others.",
